      "text": [
        "What we do",
        "Everything your website needs, in one place",
        "You run the business. We handle the website — from the first sketch to the day-to-day upkeep.",
        "Website design & build",
        "A clean, fast site built around what your customers actually need to do: find you, understand you, and get in touch or book.",
        "Hosting & maintenance",
        "We host your site on fast, secure infrastructure and keep software, plugins and certificates up to date, quietly, in the background.",
        "Content updates",
        "Changed your opening hours, added a new service, or run out of a product? Send us the details and we'll update the site, usually the same day.",
        "Local SEO basics",
        "We set your site up to be found on Google for the searches that matter — your town, your trade, your services.",
        "Security & backups",
        "Daily backups and an SSL certificate as standard, so if anything ever goes wrong, we can have you back online quickly.",
        "A real person to call",
        "No ticket queues. You get a direct line to the person who actually built your site, whenever you need a hand."
